   "en": "«MISHNA:» «If one put» the eiruv «in a cupboard» and locked it, «and the key was lost,» so that he is now unable to open the cupboard and access the eiruv, «it is» nonetheless a valid «eiruv. Rabbi Eliezer says: If he does not know that the key is in its place, it is not» a valid «eiruv.»"
  }
